Optional Extension configuration:
{"time":"[time:%H%M;Europe/Brussels]","mode":"rounded","font_family":"bebas","font_size":0,"dimmed_color":"#383631","burn_in_shift_minutes":60}

mode rounded (default) selects the nearest five-minute phrase. mode minute-dots uses the preceding five-minute phrase and one to four filled corner dots for the remaining minutes. mode accurate uses a separate square face to spell every minute, such as IT IS THIRTEEN PAST FIVE. The button's resolved background and text colors are always used for the clock face and highlighted words. font_size 0 automatically selects the largest bundled font that fits the selected letter matrix. Use one of 12, 14, 18, 24, 32, 36, or 48 to prefer a specific size; it reduces automatically if necessary.
